    <string name="tuto_welcome_title">Welcome to Pau\'delis 🚌</string>
    <string name="tuto_welcome_body">This app shows you real-time next buses of the Idelis network in Pau.\n\nSwipe left or press \"Next\" to discover the app. You can also press the Help button at the top right of tabs to open the specific guide.</string>
    <string name="tuto_map_title">The Map</string>
    <string name="tuto_map_body">The Map tab (🗺️) at the bottom shows you all the network stops on a map.\n\nPinch to zoom. Stop names appear when zooming in. Press a stop to see the next buses.</string>
    <string name="tuto_locate_title">Locate me on the map</string>
    <string name="tuto_locate_body">Press the blue button at the bottom right of the map to locate yourself and see your position live.\n\nThe app will ask for permission to access your location.</string>
    <string name="tuto_nearest_title">Nearest stop</string>
    <string name="tuto_nearest_body">The small 🚏 button at the top right of the map opens directly the stop details of the bus stop nearest to you.\n\nHandy to know the next bus without searching on the map!</string>
    <string name="tuto_favs_title">Favorites</string>
    <string name="tuto_favs_body">Press the star ⭐ in a stop or line details to put it in favorites.\n\nYour favorites appear in the ⭐ tab with the next passage updated automatically.</string>
    <string name="tuto_colors_title">Understanding colors</string>
    <string name="tuto_colors_body">In your favorites and schedules, colors indicate the bus status:\n\n%1$s = on time\n%2$s = delayed\n%3$s = early\n%4$s = cancelled\n* = scheduled time (without real-time info)</string>
    <string name="tuto_search_title">Search</string>
    <string name="tuto_search_body">Press 🔍 to search for a stop or line by its name.\n\nThe app remembers your last searches to quickly find your habits.</string>
    <string name="tuto_alerts_title">Alerts</string>
    <string name="tuto_alerts_body">Press 🔔 to create an alarm for your bus.\n\nChoose the stop, the line and the time: you will receive a notification on your phone at the scheduled time.</string>
    <string name="tuto_customize_alert_title">Customize an alert</string>
    <string name="tuto_customize_alert_body">An alert can ring every day, only some days (e.g.: Monday and Wednesday), excluding school holidays and public holidays, or only on chosen dates.\n\nYou can also exclude particular dates.</string>
    <string name="tuto_tabs_title">The More tab</string>
    <string name="tuto_tabs_body">The \"···\" button at the bottom right gives access to all functions: list of stops, lines, settings and this tutorial.\n\nYou can customize which tabs appear at the bottom in Settings.</string>
    <string name="tuto_settings_title">Settings</string>
    <string name="tuto_settings_body">In ⚙️ Settings, you can:\n\n• Change language\n• Choose light or dark theme\n• Configure the widget for the home screen\n• Reorganize tabs</string>
    <string name="tuto_widget_title">The Widget</string>
    <string name="tuto_widget_body">Add the Pau\'delis widget to your home screen: your favorite stops are displayed directly without opening the app.\n\nTo add it: hold your finger on the home screen → Widgets → Pau\'delis.</string>
    <string name="tuto_go_title">Let\'s go!</string>
    <string name="tuto_go_body">You now know how to use Pau\'delis.\n\nIf you need to review this guide, it is available at any time in the \"···\" tab → Tutorial.</string>

